  "application_type_full": "Full planning permission",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Commencement of development (Full Permission)</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development to which\r\nthis permission relates shall be commenced not later than the expiration of 3\r\nyears from the date of this permission.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason:</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">  To comply with Section 91\r\n(as amended) of the Town & Country Planning Act 1990.</span></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Approved Plans</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out\r\nin accordance with the following approved plans:&nbsp;</span></span>Site Location Plan; PDA1-01A; PDA1-02A</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper\r\nplanning</span></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">External Materials as Specified</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The facing materials to be used for the\r\ndevelopment hereby permitted shall be those specified in the application form\r\nunless otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:  To ensure a satisfactory\r\nappearance of the development and to comply with the following Development Plan\r\npolicies for Merton: policies D4 and D8 of the London Plan 2021, policies D12.1\r\nand D12.3 of the Local Plan 2024.</span><s></s></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14.6667px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><u>Removal of PD (Alterations)</u> - Notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (or any Order revoking and re-enacting that Order with or without modification), no extension, enlargement or other alteration of the outbuilding and boundary fences other than that expressly authorised by this permission shall be carried out without planning permission first obtained from the Local Planning Authority.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:&nbsp; The Local Planning\r\nAuthority considers that further development could cause detriment to the\r\namenities of the occupiers of nearby properties or to the character of the area\r\nand for this reason would wish to control any future Development plan policies\r\nfor Merton: policy D4 of the London Plan 2021 and policies D12.3 &amp; D12.4&nbsp; of the Local Plan 2024.</span></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Ancillary Residential Accommodation</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development hereby permitted shall not be rented, sold independently\r\nor occupied at any time other than for purposes ancillary to the main\r\nresidential use of the dwelling known as&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span>14 Oxford Close, Mitcham, Surrey, Merton, CR4 1DY</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" arial\",sans-serif\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">To safeguard the amenities of neighbouring\r\nresidents, to prevent the unauthorised introduction of an independent use and\r\nto ensure compliance with the following Development Plan policies for Merton:\r\npolicies D3 and D4 of the London Plan 2021 and policies D12.1 &amp; D12.3 of\r\nthe Local Plan 2024.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>"
  ],
